---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import settings from '../../data/site-settings.json';
---
<Layout
  title_cy="Telerau Defnydd"
  title_en="Terms of Use"
  description_cy="Telerau defnydd gwefan Cyngor Cymuned Llansannan"
  description_en="Terms of use for Llansannan Community Council website">

  <div class="page-banner"><h1><span lang="cy">Telerau Defnydd</span><span lang="en">Terms of Use</span></h1></div>
  <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/"><span lang="cy">Hafan</span><span lang="en">Home</span></a> &rsaquo; <span lang="cy">Telerau Defnydd</span><span lang="en">Terms of Use</span></div>

  <div class="site-wrap"><div class="content" data-pagefind-body>
    <h2 class="sh"><span lang="cy">Telerau Defnydd</span><span lang="en">Terms of Use</span></h2><hr class="sh-rule">

    <p lang="cy"><strong>Diweddarwyd ddiwethaf:</strong> Medi 2026</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Last updated:</strong> September 2026</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Defnyddio'r wefan</span><span lang="en">Using this website</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Mae defnyddio'r wefan hon yn golygu eich bod yn cytuno â'r telerau hyn. Cyngor Cymuned Llansannan sy'n berchen ar a chynnal y wefan hon.</p>
    <p lang="en">Using this website means you agree to these terms. This website is owned and maintained by Llansannan Community Council.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Hawlfraint</span><span lang="en">Copyright</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Mae cynnwys y wefan hon wedi'i ddiogelu gan hawlfraint y Goron ac mae ar gael dan drwydded agored y llywodraeth (OGL) oni nodir yn wahanol. Gallwch ddefnyddio a rhannu'r wybodaeth hon yn rhydd, gan gydnabod y ffynhonnell.</p>
    <p lang="en">The content of this website is protected by Crown copyright and is available under the Open Government Licence (OGL) unless otherwise stated. You are free to use and share this information, acknowledging the source.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Dolenni allanol</span><span lang="en">External links</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Mae dolenni i wefannau allanol wedi'u cynnwys er hwylustod yn unig. Nid ydym yn cymryd cyfrifoldeb am gynnwys gwefannau eraill.</p>
    <p lang="en">Links to external websites are included for convenience only. We take no responsibility for the content of other websites.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Cywirdeb gwybodaeth</span><span lang="en">Accuracy of information</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Rydym yn ymdrechu i gadw'r wybodaeth ar y wefan hon yn gyfredol a chywir. Fodd bynnag, nid ydym yn cymryd cyfrifoldeb am unrhyw anghywirdebau. Dylid cyfeirio penderfyniadau pwysig at y clerc.</p>
    <p lang="en">We endeavour to keep the information on this website current and accurate. However, we accept no responsibility for any inaccuracies. Important decisions should be referred to the clerk.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Newidiadau i'r telerau</span><span lang="en">Changes to these terms</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Gallwn newid y telerau hyn ar unrhyw adeg. Bydd parhad i ddefnyddio'r wefan yn awgrymu eich bod yn derbyn y newidiadau.</p>
    <p lang="en">We may change these terms at any time. Continued use of the website implies acceptance of any changes.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Cyfraith lywodraethol</span><span lang="en">Governing law</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Llywodraethir y telerau hyn gan gyfraith Cymru a Lloegr.</p>
    <p lang="en">These terms are governed by the law of England and Wales.</p>

    <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`mailto:${settings.council.email}`} class="btn-primary"><span lang="cy">Cysylltu â ni</span><span lang="en">Contact us</span></a></p>
  </div></div>
</Layout>
